Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Carrier: daily truck availability (empty / backhaul),
 fleet gate, dispatcher-only-if-posted rule (bl_avail_0320)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Load Board: 'Post my truck' → 'Post your availability' with Situation (EMPTY now / BOOKED → backhaul from delivery point), daily default window, '✓ Today' confirm per post, freshness line.
- Dashboard + Load Board: availability card — Dispatcher working / Confirm today / Dispatcher paused / Fleet needed (routes to #fleet/add-truck | add-driver).
- New module app/carrier/availability.js (additive). api.js: confirmTruckPosting, myAvailabilityStatus.
- Migration bl_avail_0320 (STAGING applied + tested; prod pending): post_kind, last_confirmed_at, fleet gate LB003/LB004 in cc_post_truck, cc_confirm_truck_posting, cc_my_availability_status; revokes PUBLIC/anon from cc_update_truck_posting(uuid,text,jsonb).
- docs: carrier email draft (owner sends).

