From d57eea77781a7cbe658d3d9c26e8be6b6bbdcb7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yaseen <20190myaseen@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 09:03:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Availability v3: Not available / Available toggle,
 one-call save, dates blank on every reopen (bl_avail_0322)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Row toggle: 'Not available' takes the truck off the board (values kept, dispatcher stops); 'Available' reopens the full card prefilled with everything EXCEPT the dates.
- Dates are never prefilled from the last save on an existing post; required + min today, past windows rejected client- and server-side.
- Existing-post save is now ONE RPC (cc_update_truck_posting_place widened) that also re-activates + re-confirms — no half-applied two-call edit.
- cc_my_availability_status returns paused; new card state 'You marked it not available' with Available-again; fresh state names any switched-off trucks.
- Dispatcher workspace shows 'Carrier marked this truck NOT AVAILABLE — do not source for it.'

